						],
						"stepId": 1502201,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Xilonen"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1350.876,
							161.634,
							7851.647
						],
						"pointId": 350400213
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150220101,
					"content": "So Allpa says that Tepal's from the Children of Echoes. But how do we track him down? Just... ask around until we find him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220102,
					"content": "Let's start by talking to someone we know. It'll be faster that way. At this time and place, I'll bet the easiest person to find is:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220103,
					"content": "Wakey-wakey, Xilonen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220104,
					"content": "*yawn* Ah, it's you... Ugh, okay... Give me a second, I'll come down...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220105,
					"content": "*yawn*...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220106,
					"content": "Seems like you two both love climbing trees...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220107,
					"content": "I climb trees to fly further and see farther. I don't usually stop for a nap.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220108,
					"content": "Well, we're not all like you — always full of energy, even after flying around all day... So. You've come all this way and interrupted my precious nap time. Might I inquire as to why?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220109,
					"content": "I'm sorry, Xilonen, but it couldn't wait. Does the name \"Tepal\" mean anything to you? He's a craftsman, apparently.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220110,
					"content": "Tepal? Yes, that rings a bell... I think that's Puma's child.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220111,
					"content": "Is he in the tribe right now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220112,
					"content": "Nope, I'm afraid you're a few years too late... Why are you looking for him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220113,
					"content": "It's a long story...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220114,
					"content": "You try to explain what happened simply and briefly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220115,
					"content": "\"Phlogiston Wings\"? Wow, okay. The kid actually pulled it off... Well, looks like no more rest for me today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220116,
					"content": "Pulled it off? You mean he's tried making something like this before?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220117,
					"content": "Yeah, he started trying to build a flying machine right after he got back from the Flower-Feather Clan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220118,
					"content": "So right after he went wingless, then... Was this flying machine anything like the gun you made me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220119,
					"content": "You mean, your gun that's harder to tame than the proudest qucusaur? No, he wanted to build something that allows anyone to fly freely, even if they're not naturally gifted.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220120,
					"content": "But... he never got very far back then, though. Blew up his workshop a few times and barely made it out alive. I never really kept up with him after that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220121,
					"content": "His parents traveled a lot in their youth, and only returned to the tribe after he was born. But they settled in a remote area, and don't interact with other people much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220122,
					"content": "Which means, most people in the tribe don't know them very well... Your best bet is to chat to his direct family.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220123,
					"content": "I'll go get Puma. Wait for me in front of the workshop, I won't be long.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1502202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1502202
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
