						],
						"pointId": 350900006
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150220301,
					"content": "Chasca, you're finally back! Things are getting really tense in the tribe. Have you made any headway with your investigation?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220302,
					"content": "Some people think we arrested the merchants just to support the flying squad and crack down on the Phlogiston Wings.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220303,
						150220304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allpa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220303,
					"content": "If things are still escalating even though we've rounded up the merchants...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220305,
					"content": "We've found some promising leads, but there's a major obstacle standing between us and the irrefutable evidence we need...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220306,
					"content": "Chasca explains what you found out about Tepal, and your theory about the airborne workshop...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220307,
					"content": "A relic from the Cinder City? Ugh... so Och-Kan's still managing to sow discord, even after all these years...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220308,
					"content": "An airborne workshop... and a hot air balloon above the trial arena... And that's where you're trying to get to now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allpa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220309,
					"content": "Any ideas how we can get up there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150220310,
					"content": "Neither Phlogiston Wings nor a qucusaur can take you that high up. Do you really think that's where Tepal is hiding?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allpa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220311,
					"content": "Hmm... You know what... There might just be a way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220312,
					"content": "Really!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220313,
					"content": "Do you still remember those spouts in the arena? When they were all blocked, the gaseous phlogiston was trapped and unable to flow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220314,
					"content": "But now, it's flowing freely. If we were to block them up again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220315,
					"content": "You mean... All of them except the one at the very top of the arena? To build up the pressure there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220316,
					"content": "Precisely. With all the gaseous phlogiston flowing through one spout, it would create a high-pressure wind current...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220317,
					"content": "And then we just ride it up into the sky.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220318,
					"content": "Yes. It has its risks, but with Chasca's abilities, I think she could manage it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220319,
					"content": "It's an extremely risky approach... but I agree that it's feasible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Allpa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220320,
					"content": "If you want to give it a try, check with Inkanak at the trial grounds. She can explain how to block the spouts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220321,
					"content": "Chasca... If anyone has a hope of seizing this evidence from the high heavens, it is you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mutota"
				},
				{
					"id": 150220304,
					"content": "Maybe there are other parties out there fanning the flames too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150220305
					]
				}
			]
		},
