					"nextDialogs": [
						150221103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221103,
					"content": "Maybe so, but we have to act fast. What's the quickest way for us to block off the spouts?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221104,
					"content": "From a technical perspective, I'd have to advise taking some measurements and carefully planning this out first... But I'm guessing that's not what you want to hear?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221105,
					"content": "Right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150221106,
					"content": "...Then we'll have to take the rough-and-ready approach. See the solid phlogiston over there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221107,
					"content": "Our prior inspections revealed that some kind of stable structure has formed inside, making it highly damage-resistant...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221108,
					"content": "It's not without its weak points, but unless they're all struck at the same time, the structural integrity won't be threatened...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221109,
					"content": "So... what happens if we do strike them all at once?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221110,
					"content": "It'll collapse.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221111,
					"content": "...Okay, I see where you're going with this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221112,
					"content": "Yeah, you got it! As long as you hit all the weak spots at once from the right angle, the solid phlogiston will fall right on top of the spout, and block it up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150221113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Inkanak"
				},
				{
					"id": 150221113,
					"content": "You're right about \"rough and ready\"... Sounds like my kind of plan.",
